2026-07-27T06:21:44.6674692Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6675441Z i /tmp/RtmpHlDvIl/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6675975Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6676594Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6677839Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6678741Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6679965Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6680852Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T06:21:44.6931447Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:21:44.7042910Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:21:44.7490113Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:21:44.7660122Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
